  "reasoning": "The defendant broke into a university building by climbing over a wall and damaging a window, then stole electric cable valued at 44,660 yuan. The conduct constitutes illegal taking of another's property with intent to appropriate, i.e., theft (盗窃). While the window was damaged, the primary criminal act described and charged in similar cases is theft; no other distinct offenses (e.g., fraud, drug offenses) are present.",
  "final_answer": "盗窃"
}
